Algorithm usage description:
The aim of this project is to provide a logistics vehicle delivery path planning solution based on immune cloning algorithm, in order to solve the problems of high delivery costs and low efficiency caused by insufficient consideration of traditional path planning. This method combines time window constraints, road congestion conditions, and capacity constraints to construct a mathematical model, and uses immune cloning algorithm to find the optimal delivery path.
